      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is no octopus boards using OCPC. Multi-charger support in octopus originates from https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/2407620. It was cherry-picked for Casta to support a secondary charger but we could support a 2nd charger differently because Casta is using only one charger (i.e. chg_cnt is always 1).\n\nI cherry-picked this CL to make the following cherry-picks smooth. It\u0027s a benign change. All boards except Foob advanced beyond 11297.222.0, where CL:2407620 was introduced. So, I think we can stay in this route (multi charger support) without worry about inhibiting (future) FW qualification.",
